    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the reply. i mean i have been super stressed with work lately and im barely getting 5 hours a night. do you think it's more likely that its just the stress/lack of sleep? like, i don't really want to go to a doctor if it's just something i can fix with more rest or maybe some vitamins or something. what do u think?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
