      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If you're not experiencing other concerning symptoms, stress and sleep deprivation might indeed be contributing factors. Cognitive impairment and linguistic blanking can be related to sleep deprivation, and addressing your sleep habits could help alleviate the issue. However, supplements like vitamins or any quick fixes might not fully address the underlying stress and exhaustion. A healthcare professional can assess your overall condition and provide guidance on the most effective solutions.",
