    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you about the doctor thing but i really just want to try handling it myself first. i dont want to deal with the whole hospital/doctor thing unless it's like an actual emergency. if i just take some high dose melatonin to sleep better and maybe some B12 or magnesium, do you think that would be enough to clear up the brain fog? like, is it safe to just try a bunch of supplements to see if that fixes the word-finding thing?",
